position-absolute top-0 end-0&#8243;]<style>.spacer-69aebe7b0c3a8 { height:650px; }@media (max-width: 991px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c3a8 { height:500px; }}@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c3a8 { height:270px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c3a8 { height:270px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c3a8\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c3a8\" data-height=\"650\" data-height-tab-portrait=\"500\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"270\" data-height-mobile=\"270\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1742899717490{background-image: url(https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/homepage-banner_filters.png?id=733) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: contain !important;}&#8221;]<style>.spacer-69aebe7b0c402 { height:650px; }@media (max-width: 991px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c402 { height:500px; }}@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c402 { height:270px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c402 { height:270px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c402\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c402\" data-height=\"650\" data-height-tab-portrait=\"500\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"270\" data-height-mobile=\"270\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section][vc_row css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221;][vc_column width=&#8221;1\/12&#8243;][\/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;10\/12&#8243; el_class=&#8221;text-center&#8221;]<style>.spacer-69aebe7b0c457 { height:60px; }@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c457 { height:30px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c457 { height:30px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c457\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c457\" data-height=\"60\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"30\" data-height-mobile=\"30\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1>PlasmaMade E-Filters:<br \/>\neen enorme upgrade voor de keuken<\/h1>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]PlasmaMade biedt een revolutionair gepatenteerd recirculatie-filtersysteem voor de keuken. PlasmaMade E-Filters verwijderen niet alleen ongewenste geuren maar zijn ook actief tegen bijvoorbeeld ziekteverwekkers, allergenen en zelfs fijnstof. Deze unieke elektronische filters passen op vrijwel elke afzuigkap of kookplaat met ge\u00efntegreerde afzuiging. Met een PlasmaMade E-Filter geef je elke keuken een enorme upgrade.[\/vc_column_text]<style>.spacer-69aebe7b0c49b { height:60px; }@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c49b { height:30px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c49b { height:30px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c49b\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c49b\" data-height=\"60\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"30\" data-height-mobile=\"30\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8221;1\/12&#8243;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section full_width=&#8221;stretch_row&#8221; el_class=&#8221;section-wide rounded-5 mb-7&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1740738671114{background-color: #F8F8F8 !important;}&#8221;][vc_row][vc_column]<div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c4c3\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c4c3\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;height:30px;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row content_placement=&#8221;middle&#8221;][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;2\/3&#8243; el_class=&#8221;pe-lg-7&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Plus X Award<\/h2>\n<p>De PlasmaMade E-Filter, ontwikkeld en geproduceerd in Nederland, is door de internationale jury van de PLUS X AWARD 2025 onderscheiden in vijf categorie\u00ebn tegelijk: Innovation, High Quality, Functionality, Ergonomics en Ecology.[\/vc_column_text]<div class=\"btn-container d-inline \"><a href =\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/nieuws\/plus-x-award\/\" title=\"Lees meer over Plus X Award\" class=\"position-relative btn btn-primary\" style=\"\"   ><span class=\"btn-text\">Lees meer<\/span><\/a><\/div><style>@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c517 { height:30px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c517 { height:30px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c517\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c517\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"30\" data-height-mobile=\"30\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;1860&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium-large&#8221; onclick=&#8221;custom_link&#8221; css=&#8221;&#8221; link=&#8221;https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/nieuws\/plus-x-award\/&#8221; el_class=&#8221;mb-0&#8243;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row content_placement=&#8221;middle&#8221; disable_element=&#8221;yes&#8221;][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;2\/3&#8243; el_class=&#8221;pe-lg-7&#8243;][vc_raw_html css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;mb-3&#8243;][\/vc_raw_html][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]Productontwikkeling is een continuproces bij PlasmaMade. De productlijn wordt regelmatig uitgebreid met E-Filters waarin de nieuwste technische inzichten en mogelijkheden zijn verwerkt. De jongste aanwinsten in het assortiment zijn de modellen GUC1223 (voor afzuigkappen) en GUC1323 (voor kookplaten met ge\u00efntegreerde afzuiging).[\/vc_column_text]<div class=\"btn-container d-inline \"><a href =\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/e-filters\/\" title=\"Lees meer over onze nieuwe modellen E-Filters\" class=\"position-relative btn btn-primary\" style=\"\"   ><span class=\"btn-text\">Ontdek onze E-Filters<\/span><\/a><\/div><style>@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c560 { height:30px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c560 { height:30px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c560\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c560\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"30\" data-height-mobile=\"30\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243; el_class=&#8221;px-xl-6&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;512&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium-large&#8221; css=&#8221;&#8221;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<style>.spacer-69aebe7b0c57f { height:50px; }@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c57f { height:30px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c57f { height:30px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c57f\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c57f\" data-height=\"50\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"30\" data-height-mobile=\"30\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section][vc_row][vc_column el_class=&#8221;text-center&#8221;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>PlasmaMade E-Filters rekenen af met:<\/h2>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c59b\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c59b\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;height:30px;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221;][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243; offset=&#8221;vc_col-md-3&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;text-center&#8221;]<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-26 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/fijnstof.png\" alt=\"Fijnstof\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/fijnstof-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/fijnstof-100x100.png 100w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/fijnstof-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 85px) 100vw, 85px\" \/>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Fijnstof<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Zelfs microscopisch kleine grove deeltjes, zoals verbrandingsstoffen, rook en stof, worden compleet afgebroken.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243; offset=&#8221;vc_col-md-3&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;text-center&#8221;]<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-25 size-thumbnail\" src=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/ziekteverwekkers-150x150.png\" alt=\"Ziekteverwekkers\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/ziekteverwekkers-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/ziekteverwekkers-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/ziekteverwekkers-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 85px) 100vw, 85px\" \/>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Ziekteverwekkers<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Virussen, bacteri\u00ebn, aerosolen en andere micro-organismen worden tot 98% gefilterd.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243; offset=&#8221;vc_col-md-3&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;text-center&#8221;]<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-27 size-thumbnail\" src=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/allergenen-150x150.png\" alt=\"Allergenen\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/allergenen-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/allergenen-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/allergenen-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 85px) 100vw, 85px\" \/>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Allergenen<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Pollen, huisstofmijt en andere veroorzakers van allergie\u00ebn en luchtwegklachten worden uit de lucht gehaald.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243; offset=&#8221;vc_col-md-3&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;text-center&#8221;]<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-28 size-thumbnail\" src=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/geuren-150x150.png\" alt=\"Geuren\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/geuren-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/geuren-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/geuren-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 85px) 100vw, 85px\" \/>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Ongewenste luchtjes<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Alle soorten geuren en vluchtige organische stoffen (VOS) worden afgebroken.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<style>.spacer-69aebe7b0c5b6 { height:60px; }@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c5b6 { height:30px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c5b6 { height:30px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c5b6\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c5b6\" data-height=\"60\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"30\" data-height-mobile=\"30\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section][vc_row][vc_column el_class=&#8221;text-center&#8221;]<div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c5cb\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c5cb\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;height:30px;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row content_placement=&#8221;middle&#8221;][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243; el_class=&#8221;pe-lg-7 position-relative&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;649&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; css_animation=&#8221;slideInRight&#8221; css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;position-absolute top-0 start-0 mt-n7 ms-n7 animated&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;516&#8243; img_size=&#8221;medium-large&#8221; css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;rounded-5&#8243;][\/vc_column][vc_column css_animation=&#8221;none&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/2&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Volop voordelen<\/h2>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]Naast schone, frisse lucht bieden PlasmaMade E-Filters nog veel meer pluspunten.[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;checked-list-success&#8221;]<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Energiebesparing door recirculatie<\/li>\n<li>Duurzaam: voor 97% recyclebaar<\/li>\n<li>In een handomdraai gemonteerd, draai-klem sluiting<\/li>\n<li>Levensduur 10 \u00e0 15 jaar<\/li>\n<li>Minder geluid, meer rust<\/li>\n<li>Gehele levensduur 100% kwaliteit zonder degeneratie<\/li>\n<li>Klein formaat, ook geschikt voor design kappen<\/li>\n<li>Grote luchtdoorlaat: Energiezuinig<\/li>\n<li>Wereldwijde certificering<\/li>\n<li>Snelle en effectieve eliminatie van fijnstof<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c5dd\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c5dd\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;height:80px;\"><\/div><div class=\"contentbox contentbox-69aebe7b0c631 \" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c631\" style=\" \">[vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Vind je PlasmaMade E-Filter<\/h2>\n<p>Benieuwd of er ook voor jouw afzuigkap of kookplaat een passend PlasmaMade E-Filter verkrijgbaar is?[\/vc_column_text]<div class=\"btn-container d-inline \"><a href =\"https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/filter-finder\/\" title=\"Zoek een passend E-Filter voor uw afzuigkap of kookplaat\" class=\"position-relative btn btn-primary\" style=\"\"   ><span class=\"btn-text\">Zoek een passend E-Filter<\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<style>.spacer-69aebe7b0c6a2 { height:60px; }@media (max-width: 767px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c6a2 { height:30px; }}@media (max-width: 479px) { .spacer-69aebe7b0c6a2 { height:30px; }}<\/style><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c6a2\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c6a2\" data-height=\"60\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"30\" data-height-mobile=\"30\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section full_width=&#8221;stretch_row_content&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1740129510093{background-image: url(https:\/\/www.plasmamade.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/bg-reviews.jpg?id=81) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}&#8221;][vc_row][vc_column]<div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0c6b8\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0c6b8\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;height:80px;\"><\/div>[vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221; el_class=&#8221;text-white&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Klanten aan het woord<\/h2>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<style>.owl-stage { display: -webkit-flex; display: -ms-flexbox; display: flex; -webkit-flex-wrap: wrap; -ms-flex-wrap: wrap; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.owl-item { display: -webkit-flex; display: -ms-flexbox; display: flex; height: auto !important; }\n.owl-carousel .owl-stage-outer { height: calc(100% + 30px); margin: -15px; padding: 15px; width: calc(100% + 30px);}\n.owl-stage { padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;}\n.owl-item { opacity: .5; box-shadow:none; }\n.owl-item .item { background-color: white; box-shadow:none; }\n.owl-item.active.center { opacity: 1; }\n.owl-item.active.center .item { background-color:white;  box-shadow: var(--bs-box-shadow)!important;  }\n.owl-item.active.center .author { font-weight: bold; }\n.owl-item { -webkit-transform: scale(.8) !important; transform: scale(.8) !important; }\n.owl-item.active.center { -webkit-transform: scale(1.1) !important; transform: scale(1.1) !important; }<\/style><div id=\"owl-carousel-0\" class=\"owl-69aebe7b0c6ed owl-carousel owl-theme owl-nav-bottom\"><div class=\"item p-4 mx-4 mx-sm-5 mx-lg-0 rounded-4 border small\"><p>\u201cHet PlasmaMade E-Filter is een mooie uitvinding. We hebben het nu een jaar in gebruik en het werkt uitstekend. Bovendien hoeft het filter maar eens in de 10 \u00e0 15 jaar vervangen te worden, dat scheelt een hoop gedoe. Wij zijn er blij mee!\u201c<\/p><p class=\"author\">Daphne Zeilmaker<\/p><\/div><div class=\"item p-4 mx-4 mx-sm-5 mx-lg-0 rounded-4 border small\"><p>\u201cWij zijn heel blij met het PlasmaMade E-Filter. Onze zoon heeft door hyperactieve bronchi\u00ebn altijd veel last gehad van benauwdheid. Dat gaat intussen al een stuk beter. We hebben ook veel minder last van vieze geurtjes bij het koken. Kortom, een echte aanrader.\u201d<\/p><p class=\"author\">Eric van Vugt<\/p><\/div><div class=\"item p-4 mx-4 mx-sm-5 mx-lg-0 rounded-4 border small\"><p>\u201cWij zijn erg tevreden over het PlasmaMade E-Filter. Het maakt echt een groot verschil in onze keuken: veel frissere lucht en minder keukenluchtjes.\u201d<\/p><p class=\"author\">Bart Captein<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0d069\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0d069\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;height:100px;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][\/vc_section][vc_section][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text css=&#8221;&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Onze certificeringen<\/h2>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<div class=\"spacer spacer-69aebe7b0d081\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0d081\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;height:50px;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<div class=\"templatera_shortcode\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"contentbox contentbox-69aebe7b0e55c d-flex justify-content-center flex-row gap-5\" data-id=\"69aebe7b0e55c\" style=\" \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=